==English==
{{wikipedia}}
{{wikipedia|partnership (cricket)}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|partner|ship}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈpɑːtnəʃɪp/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈpɑɹtnɚʃɪp/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|en-au-partnership.ogg|a=AU}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The state of being [[associated]] with a [[partner]].
# An [[association]] of two or more people to [[conduct]] a [[business]]
#: {{ux|en|forge a '''partnership'''}}
# {{lb|en|cricket}} The [[period]] when two specific [[batsmen]] are batting, from the fall of one [[wicket]] until the fall of the next; the [[number]] of [[run]]s [[score]]d during this period,

